#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:49
#: f66c53451ef340db9591147d198a01ce
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:51
#: 5ee1046150684fd5b95ca19c9b01feec
msgid ""
"The IR-LOCK sensor can be connected directly to the autopilot via an `I2C "
"cable <https://irlock.com/collections/shop/products/pixhawk-cable>`__. If "
"you are using multiple I2C sensors, then you will need an \\ `I2C splitter "
"<https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-DF13-I2C-Bus-Splitter-for-Pixhawk-p/mro-"
"df13-i2c-split-5-mr.htm>`__. More detailed instructions are included in the "
"`IR-LOCK documentation <https://irlock.readme.io/docs>`__."
msgstr ""
"IR-LOCK 传感器可通过 `I2C 线缆 "
"<https://irlock.com/collections/shop/products/pixhawk-cable>`__ "
"直接连接到飞控。如果您使用多个 I2C 传感器，则需要一个 `I2C 分线器 <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-"
"DF13-I2C-Bus-Splitter-for-Pixhawk-p/mro-"
"df13-i2c-split-5-mr.htm>`__。更详细的说明请参阅 `IR-LOCK 文档 "
"<https://irlock.readme.io/docs>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:55
#: 5bce53c3e2c649368889eee29890cb9d
msgid ""
"Other ``PLND_`` parameters are provided to adjust for landing detector "
"position on the vehicle, if needed."
msgstr "如需调整飞行器上降落探测器的位置，还提供了其他 ``PLND_`` 参数。"

