#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:92
#: f0553c250df74ed3916c1fa4d993d48b
msgid "Setup through Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:94
#: ab501e0df8354be3935c7c672f97efac
msgid ""
"Set the following parameters through the Mission Planner (or other GCS) to "
"enable the precision landing feature and then Reboot the autopilot."
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner（或其他地面站）设置以下参数以启用精准降落功能，然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:97
#: 52cf96cd3a6540f590ded45a96b185b6
msgid ":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:98
#: 1bf3e992b6a04559a7b6a94c48303ede
msgid ":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 2"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:100
#: af6ba5b7c6be4252b5efe8b535fd7743
msgid ""
"To enable Precision Loiter, an :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switch <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` must be set to 39 (PrecLoiter Enable). In versions "
"prior to Copter-4.0, a CHx_OPT parameter could be set via Mission Planner to"
" 39 for this enable."
msgstr ""
"要启用精准悬停，必须将一个 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 设置为 39（PrecLoiter "
"Enable）。在 Copter-4.0 之前的版本中，可以通过 Mission Planner 将 CHx_OPT 参数设置为 39 来启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:105
#: 1aa8663116c945399c0ab52ae719d8d8
msgid "Flying and Testing"
msgstr "飞行与测试"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:107
#: a1bbf60468844fbe8dcaa3df5182efc2
msgid ""
"Setup the vehicle with one of the flight modes set to Land (as of the time "
"this wiki page was written, the precision landing function only operates in "
"Land mode)."
msgstr "将飞行器的某个飞行模式设置为 Land（截至本文撰写时，精准降落功能仅在 Land 模式下运行）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:111
#: c511822a739f4b2eadec46f7f85d68a5
msgid ""
"Place the IR beacon on the ground and take-off to approximately 10m above "
"the target. Switch the vehicle to Land. If everything is working properly, "
"the copter should move toward the IR beacon. A successful demo is shown "
"below (using an older firmware)."
msgstr ""
"将红外信标放置在地面上，起飞至目标上方约 10 米处。将飞行器切换至 Land "
"模式。如果一切正常，多旋翼应向红外信标移动。以下展示了一个成功的演示（使用旧版固件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:118
#: 7892a85f448844bc8e3b0ce2f9fa8f37
msgid ""
"Be prepared to retake control if there are sudden unexpected movements "
"(Change mode to Stabilize, AltHold or Loiter)."
msgstr "如出现突然的意外动作，请准备好重新接管控制（切换模式至 Stabilize、AltHold 或 Loiter）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:121
#: 72f672b92b3b4cd9bc449881134f27ad
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does behave appropriately, download the dataflash logs and "
"examine the PL messages."
msgstr "如果飞行器行为正常，请下载飞行日志并检查 PL 消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:124
#: 7ec10345cc624160969f9d3733155f40
msgid ""
"If the \"Heal\" (meaning health) field is not \"1\" then there may be a "
"communication issue between the autopilot and IR-LOCK sensor."
msgstr "如果\"Heal\"（即健康状态）字段不为\"1\"，则飞控与IR-LOCK传感器之间可能存在通信问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:125
#: 2f9cd79b41744135a1edfcca4f3fc43a
msgid ""
"If the \"TAcq\" (meaning Target Acquired) field is not \"1\" then the sensor"
" is not seeing the target."
msgstr "如果\"TAcq\"（即目标已捕获）字段不为\"1\"，则传感器未检测到目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:126
#: 6d7f28021e8c4df6b778af016b64ef03
msgid ""
"The pX, pY values show the horizontal distance to the target from the "
"vehicle."
msgstr "pX、pY值显示飞行器到目标的水平距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:127
#: c9ec5c61a343455e8c97417a41be75d2
msgid ""
"The vX, vY values show the estimated velocity of the target relative to the "
"vehicle."
msgstr "vX、vY值显示目标相对于飞行器的估计速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:132
#: a2e5cfa2caa74325b7632426f4160353
msgid "*Demonstration of consecutive precision landings.*"
msgstr "*连续精准降落演示。*"
